    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2024_0479","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ásdís Tanaka talks about a portrait of the wind, from behind. The artist insists the recording itself is the artwork and that we are now co-authors.</Description>
